 ## Background
-The family originates from the application of 3D Gaussian Splatting to X-ray tomography, leveraging the differentiable nature of Gaussian splatting to solve inverse problems in medical and industrial imaging. Radiative Gaussian Splatting introduced the concept of replacing RGB with scalar density for CT reconstruction [Radiative Gaussian Splatting](3040-radiative-gaussian-splatting.md). X-Gaussian extended this to novel view synthesis and sparse-view reconstruction, highlighting performance advantages over NeRF-based methods [X-Gaussian](4525-x-gaussian.md). The Radiative Gaussian Point Cloud Model further refined the attribute representation using a Radiation Intensity Response Function to avoid spherical harmonics [Radiative Gaussian Point Cloud Model](5304-radiative-gaussian-point-cloud-model.md). Volumetric Primitives Radiance Field represents a divergence towards ray-primitive intersection methods for radiance field rendering [Volumetric Primitives Radiance Field](5900-volumetric-primitives-radiance-field.md).
+The family originates from the application of 3D Gaussian Splatting to X-ray tomography, leveraging the differentiable nature of Gaussian splatting to solve inverse problems in medical and industrial imaging [G]. Radiative Gaussian Splatting introduced the concept of replacing RGB with scalar density for CT reconstruction . X-Gaussian extended this to novel view synthesis and sparse-view reconstruction, highlighting performance advantages over NeRF-based methods . The Radiative Gaussian Point Cloud Model further refined the attribute representation using a Radiation Intensity Response Function to avoid spherical harmonics . Volumetric Primitives Radiance Field represents a divergence towards ray-primitive intersection methods for radiance field rendering .
 
